{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HJ3yK8Ynt5eb1tJUoiteY3","type":"tool_result","content":".claude/skills/generate-concept-figure:\nSKILL.md\n\n.claude/skills/memory-log:\nSKILL.md\nscripts\n\n.claude/skills/retrieve-references:\nSKILL.md\nscripts\ntemplates\n\n.claude/skills/scientific-evidence:\nSKILL.md\nscripts\n\n.claude/skills/validate-paper:\nSKILL.md\nscripts\ntemplates\n\n.claude/skills/write-paper-standalone:\nSKILL.md\nscripts\ntemplates\n\n## Reference planning (2026-11-11)\n- Wrote reference_query_plan.{md,json}: 10 queries over LAC/APS/RAPS, Mondrian, weighted conformal + density-ratio, conditional-coverage limits and QR thresholds, evaluation metrics, Aitchison compositional context. Chosen over generic 'conformal prediction benchmark' queries because they map to the run's variants and results; no CIFAR query since no real data used.\n\n## Paper framing (2026-11-11)\n- Chose thesis-first standalone framing: protocol-centred empirical study of gated weighted-Mondrian conformal on synthetic softmax families; final outcome qualified (score 0.8416 vs best baseline 0.8029, margin 0.0387, CI [0.0274,0.0499]); residual shift gap 0.0536 and worst-slice gap 0.0675 reported as limitations.\n- Rejected: (a) search-chronology narrative (violates standalone/no-progression rules), (b) claiming a compositional-geometry (Aitchison) method (procedure uses summary features, no evidence), (c) real-data/CIFAR claims (no results exist). Variant 3 == variant 2 in all retained metrics; cause left unknown.\n- Unknown/unsupported: per-baseline scores, per-case results, cause of search-to-final drop. Diagnostics trust 'unverified'.\n['ablation_studies', 'all_programs', 'best_any', 'best_correct', 'evidence_sources', 'final_evaluation', 'generated_at', 'grounding_sources', 'idea_titles', 'improvement_trace', 'paper_profile', 'presentation_contract', 'results_dir', 'top_programs', 'totals']\n{\n \"correct\": true,\n \"evaluation_evidence\": {\n  \"candidate_diagnostics_trust\": \"unverified\",\n  \"episode_count\": 5,\n  \"episodes\": [\n   {\n    \"correct\": true,\n    \"duration_seconds\": 7.595783748998656,\n    \"score\": 0.8120895679513737,\n    \"seed\": 9001\n   },\n   {\n    \"correct\": true,\n    \"duration_seconds\": 4.255343589989934,\n    \"score\": 0.8495374483970467,\n    \"seed\": 9002\n   },\n   {\n    \"correct\": true,\n    \"duration_seconds\": 4.261112495994894,\n    \"score\": 0.8478356006654857,\n    \"seed\": 9003\n   },\n   {\n    \"correct\": true,\n    \"duration_seconds\": 4.304887222009711,\n    \"score\": 0.8620200746172032,\n    \"seed\": 9004\n   },\n   {\n    \"correct\": true,\n    \"duration_seconds\": 4.2621792440040736,\n    \"score\": 0.8365120390314812,\n    \"seed\": 9005\n   }\n  ],\n  \"path\": \"work/results/r02/claude/20261111_085834/final_evaluation/results/evaluation_evidence.json\",\n  \"sha256\": \"sha256:fbce21f0062b1bac782ab90f4e3aaf40eea5202fb5e4ef289acd670bbd7d726f\",\n  \"status\": \"available\"\n },\n \"evaluator_sha256\": \"sha256:07d92de442539bb9f87bad457dddbc387b7485168e1ed3126b62f0c3acd27403\",\n \"manifest_path\": \"work/results/r02/claude/20261111_085834/final_evaluation/final_manifest.json\",\n \"metrics\": {\n  \"best_baseline_score\": 0.8029427290430731,\n  \"controls_passed_fraction\": 1.0,\n  \"final_score\": 0.8415989461325181,\n  \"mean_marginal_coverage_gap_exchangeable\": 0.0017125000000000003,\n  \"mean_set_size_ratio\": 0.20899275,\n  \"n_failed_episodes\": 0,\n  \"score_margin_ci_lower\": 0.027380642147787293,\n  \"score_margin_ci_upper\": 0.049946285752100215,\n  \"score_margin_vs_best_baseline\": 0.038656217089445,\n  \"shift_coverage_gap\": 0.053625000000000034,\n  \"worst_slice_coverage_gap\": 0.06752813213659413\n },\n \"outcome\": \"qualified\",\n \"program_tree_sha256\": \"sha256:38a566566bb11475dd05555e994f53a03bad5b27307801ac8aed4fea3657630f\",\n \"results_tree_sha256\": \"sha256:993d2e541d831fc145d394a178d215a3d707c69c