.best_baseline_score\"])\nadd(\"Loss decomposition: set-size term 0.0522, worst-slice term 0.0169, implied marginal term 0.0893 (mean clipped marginal gap over alpha 0.179), derived from retained case-mean metrics via the 0.5/0.25/0.25 loss.\",[\"final.metric.final_score\",\"final.metric.mean_set_size_ratio\",\"final.metric.worst_slice_coverage_gap\"])\nadd(\"Interval half-width about 0.011 and margin roughly twice the per-seed standard deviation 0.019 (derived).\",[\"final.metric.score_margin_ci_lower\",\"final.metric.score_margin_ci_upper\",\"final.metric.score_margin_vs_best_baseline\",\"final.evidence.episodes\"])\nadd(\"Full set scores exactly 0.75 under the loss definition (analytic from loss weights in evaluator source results/task/evaluate.py).\",[\"final.qualification.status\"])\nadd(\"Development scores: V1 (Mondrian LAC) 0.8683, V2 (gated weighting) 0.9192, V3 (QR thresholds) 0.9192, identical per-seed scores for V2 and V3; 3 of 3 scored, none unscored.\",[\"result.improvement_001\",\"result.improvement_002\",\"result.top_program_01\",\"result.top_program_02\",\"result.top_program_03\",\"result.total_attempts\",\"result.total_evaluated_programs\"])\nadd(\"Development secondary metrics (from per-variant evaluator metric files results/ideas/*/program_1/metrics.json): shift gap 0.0613 -> 0.0201, worst-slice gap 0.0497 -> 0.0376, set-size ratio 0.166 -> 0.181, exchangeable gap 0.00028 for V1 and V2; V3 equals V2.\",[\"result.improvement_001\",\"result.improvement_002\",\"result.top_program_03\"])\nadd(\"Paired per-seed development differences V2-V1 are 0.064, 0.043, 0.045; with three pairs the smallest two-sided exact sign-flip p-value is 0.25 (derived).\",[\"result.improvement_001\",\"result.improvement_002\"])\nadd(\"Development score of the selected procedure (0.9192) exceeds its sealed final score (0.8416); development shift gap 0.0201 and size ratio 0.181 versus final 0.0536 and 0.209; cause not isolated.\",[\"result.best_correct_score\",\"final.metric.final_score\",\"final.metric.shift_coverage_gap\",\"final.metric.mean_set_size_ratio\"])\nadd(\"Final seeds 9001-9005 and development seeds 101-103; frozen procedure evaluated once on sealed cases.\",[\"final.evidence.episodes\",\"result.top_program_01\"])\nadd(\"Margin-theory constants f(0)=0.399, f(0.7)=0.143 (ratio 0.36) from normal-approximation derivation; heuristic, not checked experimentally.\",[\"final.metric.mean_marginal_coverage_gap_exchangeable\"])\nadd(\"Related work: conditional and class-conditional conformal prediction, many/long-tailed classes, group-conditional QR calibration, Kandinsky, selection-conditional and trust-score variants (descriptions limited to titles and venues).\",[\"ref.s2.206ac9b41d419be0da5acc198f574e5bfa3c6548\",\"ref.s2.d98edf182f3a98bd3faf79e85b20c370ea4d5b66\",\"ref.s2.1e131662d21796bb1965d74de2566f785e155cdc\",\"ref.s2.d8855db15e5c40f87d1d6632616d1ced2d4a11bd\",\"ref.s2.5d074986e32ab5c912c05ed48f87cdd892024cb2\",\"ref.s2.45c540d0ed7ab1809ec4feb5d892b32250e224be\",\"ref.s2.84e3461b3fd473c7fabb6f008085a99fe85b560d\",\"ref.s2.c275d0da3df4b0e1250f4c66a68990820d79c800\",\"ref.s2.ef26ca9f4c4086efbb87e640150b721877528875\"],\n    [\"Gibbs2023ConformalPW\",\"Ding2023ClassConditionalCP\",\"Shi2024ConformalPF\",\"Melki2023GroupConditionalCP\",\"Bairaktari2025KandinskyCP\",\"Kaur2025ConformalPS\",\"Jin2024ConfidenceOT\",\"Löfström2015BiasRT\",\"Ding2025ConformalPF\"])\nadd(\"Related work: efficiency, classifier adaptation, temperature scaling, foundation-model features, Monte Carlo and interpretable-network conformal methods (titles/venues only).\",[\"ref.s2.0b7801fcffde6a3bf575fe7fad089ba92d263654\",\"ref.s2.f6912e100684aaf8a87ecb892993e2483b970283\",\"ref.s2.194bec73094aadab0b07670e09388d4e5c1b715b\",\"ref.s2.6995f3e8316bc9c0271348093f38d5f03fdc1448\",\"ref.s2.5a5fd87bc0bc85796578483f28e9fe3a59743cc1\",\"ref.s2.6c52200855e33c3c1e8c2166b0ea5a985c3ae80d\"],\n    [\"Kiyani2024LengthOI\",\"Liu2024CAdapterAD\",\"Dabah2024OnTS\",\"Fillioux2